# The Jolly Balloon Man copying a white Spirit token from Lingering Souls (CR 111.4, 707.2, 707.9d): a token has no mana
# cost, and its white is no color indicator but the copiable value the text that made it gave it, so "red in addition to
# its other colors" makes the copy white and red. Lingering Souls and Jolly are cast on turn 1 off Black Lotus and the Moxen,
# so Jolly can tap on turn 3.

